        <h1 class='oc-page-title '>Minutes and Agendas</h1>
        
        
        <p>&nbsp;This page contains meeting information for City Council, Finance Committee, Public Services Committee, Committee of the Whole, and Work Sessions. Archived meetings can be found at the following links:</p>
<p><a href="https://www.cheyennecity.org/Your-Government/City-Council/City-Council-Meeting-Videos"><span class=""><span class="emphasis-box-1"><strong>City Council</strong></span></span></a></p>
<p>Please use the following link to find additional <a href="https://www.cheyennecity.org/Your-Government/City-Council/Committees">Committee Information</a>.</p>
<p>Meetings held in Council Chambers are live streamed for the public to watch on the City's <a href="https://www.facebook.com/CityOfCheyenne">Facebook</a>&nbsp;and <a href="https://www.youtube.com/user/TheCityofCheyenne/featured">YouTube</a> pages. The public may watch and provide comment (when applicable to a meeting) remotely through Zoom. Zoom links can be found at <a href="https://www.cheyennecity.org/Home/Tabs/Featured-Links/Electronic-Conference-Meeting">www.cheyennecity.org/ecm</a>.&nbsp;</p>
